&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lawfdsko6oZQdQxizyqutN4Ls6f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Own the client-side architecture for core growth conversion flows — new user acquisition, referral and virality loops, reward mechanics, and activity-driven engagement systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve the mobile attribution system — including MMP integration, attribution modelling, and the application of attribution data across anti-fraud, channel revenue sharing, and ROI evaluation scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimise growth infrastructure including funnel instrumentation, experiment frameworks, and acquisition loops that directly serve the mobile user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Business Development, and local market teams to translate commercial goals into concrete, data-backed engineering proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical decision-making on growth infrastructure, articulating trade-offs clearly and defending or revising positions based on evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI coding tools actively in your workflow — not just for code generation, but to build and maintain repeatable personal AI development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers on the team and help establish a culture where engineers bring solutions, not just responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusJHbXag5ngXLLiXggj1zhBg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;R1MMdOP7Jor8rJxZjvEuEmM9s6b&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EJEWdyXsfojXT9xHKfDuSPpSswb&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
