&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience with a track record of shipping production-quality systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with new user growth, referral and virality mechanics, activity and reward systems, and the client-side architecture behind core business conversion flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in mobile attribution design and evolution — hands-on experience with attribution platforms and solutions, and proven ability to drive attribution data into anti-fraud, channel revenue sharing, and ROI evaluation applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in AI-assisted development — able to independently build and maintain personal AI engineering workflows, not just use AI tools ad hoc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data instincts: you think in funnels, know how to instrument what matters, and use metrics to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outspoken and proposal-driven — you come to the table with a point of view, push back when you disagree, and bring data and a counter-proposal rather than just flagging concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional communication — comfortable working with Product, Business Development, and local markets to align on goals and hold the line on engineering quality.&lt;/li&gt;
