&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Experience architecting scalable automation solutions using Workato or similar iPaaS platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntd _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of APIs, webhooks, REST, JSON, and XML.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
